  m_text: "Assun\xE7\xE3o\r\nAssumption\r\n\r\nDomingos Ant\xF3nio de Sequeira (1768\u20131837)\r\nCarv\xE3o,
    esfuminho e l\xE1pis sobre papel\r\nCharcoal with stumping and pencil on paper\r\nDep\xF3sito
    C\xE2mara Municipal do Porto / antigo MMP\r\nDeposit Porto City Council / former
    MMP\r\n107 Des CMP / MNSR"
