  m_text: "The Camera Lucida is an optical device used as a drawing aid. Through
    a system of a mirror and lenses, it projects the observed object onto the paper.
    By tracing round this image, a more precise and accurate drawing is obtained.\r\nThis
    piece was given by King Pedro to the drawing master Jo\xE3o Baptista Ribeiro,
    as shown by the inscription on the lid: D. Pedro, Duke of Bragan\xE7a, in the
    city of Porto gave this to Jo\xE3o Baptista Ribeiro in 1833."
