      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Um dos Magos\r\nAdora\xE7\xE3o dos Reis Magos \u2013 estudo\r\nOne Wise
    Man\r\nThe Adoration of the Magi \u2013 study\r\n\r\nDomingos Ant\xF3nio de Sequeira
    (1768\u20131837)\r\nCarv\xE3o, esfuminho e l\xE1pis sobre papel\r\nCharcoal with
    stumping and pencil on paper\r\nDep\xF3sito C\xE2mara Municipal do Porto / antigo
    MMP\r\nDeposit Porto City Council / former MMP\r\n119 Des CMP / MNSR"
